  "        ""text"": ""weights: 0, seven lines of 3, seven complements of 4, 7"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""A linear code, distance 3: the Hamming (7,4) code"","
  "        ""text"": ""every two codewords at least 3 bits apart: one flipped bit is corrected"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""A linear code, distance 3: the Hamming (7,4) code"","
  "        ""text"": ""4 data bits: 2^4 codewords in 7 bits"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
