  "        ""text"": ""adding, not changing: every decade keeps the base's dots"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""Dot 6 is ASCII's case bit"","
  "        ""text"": ""dot 6 alone is 0x20"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
