  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The name in bytes, and its parts against each other"","
  "        ""text"": ""`assert.deepEqual(bytes(\""THORNE\""), [0x54, 0x48, 0x4f, 0x52, 0x4e, 0x45]);`"""
