  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGELA, as AMERICA was read (I-203)"","
  "        ""text"": ""six letters: no single centre"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGELA, as AMERICA was read (I-203)"","
  "        ""text"": ""the two middle letters, G and E"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGELA, as AMERICA was read (I-203)"","
  "        ""text"": ""ALEGNA"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGELA, as AMERICA was read (I-203)"","
  "        ""text"": ""the ends match: A ... A, as in AMERICA"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGELA, as AMERICA was read (I-203)"","
  "        ""text"": ""N and L differ"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGELA, as AMERICA was read (I-203)"","
  "        ""text"": ""G and E differ: a partial palindrome, held by its A's"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGELA, as AMERICA was read (I-203)"","
  "        ""text"": ""its letters XOR to NUL: the two A's cancel, and N ^ G ^ E ^ L = 0"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGELA, as AMERICA was read (I-203)"","
  "        ""text"": ""N G E L: 4E ^ 47 ^ 45 ^ 4C"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGELA, as AMERICA was read (I-203)"","
  "        ""text"": ""AMERICA leaves a remainder; ANGELA closes on itself"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGEL: the first five, as the cave's parser reads"","
  "        ""text"": ""the first five letters (open-adventure reads five)"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGEL: the first five, as the cave's parser reads"","
  "        ""text"": ""ANGELA ^ ANGEL: five nulls, then 'a', the extra A demoted by the space"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGEL: the first five, as the cave's parser reads"","
  "        ""text"": ""ANGEL and ANGLE are anagrams"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGEL: the first five, as the cave's parser reads"","
  "        ""text"": ""and GLEAN: all three tags"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""ANGEL: the first five, as the cave's parser reads"","
  "        ""text"": ""ANGEL in base 36"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""GLUE in her name"","
  "        ""text"": ""G, L, E are in ANGELA; U is not"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""GLUE in her name"","
  "        ""text"": ""ANGELA ^ GLUE: the E's meet at index 3"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The identity as termed pixels"","
  "        ""text"": ""`assert.equal(header.length, 8);`"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The identity as termed pixels"","
  "        ""text"": ""A N G E L, then three spaces: black, the null"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The identity as termed pixels"","
  "        ""text"": ""`assert.deepEqual(header.map((p) => p.type), [\""tag\"", \""tag\"", \""tag\"", \""tag\"", \""tag\"", \""null\"", \""null\"", \""null\""]);`"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The identity as termed pixels"","
  "        ""text"": ""4 + 8 + 4 = 16: the nibble, the Polybius square, the set of 16"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The identity as termed pixels"","
  "        ""text"": ""every pixel keeps its position"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""Federation: the same tag, the same pixels; and the limit of a colour"","
  "        ""text"": ""two peers holding ANGEL: XOR 0, the same identity"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""Federation: the same tag, the same pixels; and the limit of a colour"","
  "        ""text"": ""but A and I share a colour (blue): three bits cannot name 26 letters"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""Federation: the same tag, the same pixels; and the limit of a colour"","
  "        ""text"": ""so the colour shows the tag, and the tag, the value, is the identity"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""G.L.U.E. held: G>L>U>E>, the prompt to pay it forward"","
  "        ""text"": ""the stop (2E) and the prompt (3E) differ by one bit, 0x10"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""G.L.U.E. held: G>L>U>E>, the prompt to pay it forward"","
  "        ""text"": ""the letters held, each stop turned to a prompt: DLE"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""G.L.U.E. held: G>L>U>E>, the prompt to pay it forward"","
  "        ""text"": ""Shift on a letter flips 0x20: the case bit, subject to object"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""G.L.U.E. held: G>L>U>E>, the prompt to pay it forward"","
  "        ""text"": ""Shift on the stop sets 0x10: the stop becomes the prompt"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""G.L.U.E. held: G>L>U>E>, the prompt to pay it forward"","
  "        ""text"": ""and its neighbour: Shift + , types <, the same bit"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""G.L.U.E. held: G>L>U>E>, the prompt to pay it forward"","
  "        ""text"": ""as 'greater than', only U > E: it is not a ranking"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""G.L.U.E. held: G>L>U>E>, the prompt to pay it forward"","
  "        ""text"": ""as prompts, each letter is passed on to the next: forward"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
