  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The shift held is PROPAgation: the AXIOM of PROPAgation"","
  "        ""text"": ""PROPA and AXIOM are tags"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The shift held is PROPAgation: the AXIOM of PROPAgation"","
  "        ""text"": ""the shift held over g.l.u.e. gives G>L>U>E>"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The shift held is PROPAgation: the AXIOM of PROPAgation"","
  "        ""text"": ""and over angel, the tag"""
