  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""Added without a carry: the sum is the XOR"","
  "        ""text"": ""and in decimal too: 22 + 55 = 77"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""Added without a carry: the sum is the XOR"","
  "        ""text"": ""their XNOR: 0x88"""
