  "        ""text"": ""the closure adds a 5-part counter: 7 x 3 x 5 x 240"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The 5 is the reason (P5)"","
  "        ""text"": ""15 = 3 x 5 carries one 5"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The 5 is the reason (P5)"","
  "        ""text"": ""four channels keep one 5"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The 5 is the reason (P5)"","
  "        ""text"": ""five channels make two: 75 = 3 x 5^2"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The 5 is the reason (P5)"","
  "        ""text"": ""7! has one 5, from 5!"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The 5 is the reason (P5)"","
  "        ""text"": ""the closure has 5^2"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The 5 is the reason (P5)"","
  "        ""text"": ""the whole 80-slot dial closes: 5040 = 63 x 80"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""Only the five-block dial is not a power of two (P6)"","
  "        ""text"": ""64 and 256 are powers of two"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""Only the five-block dial is not a power of two (P6)"","
  "        ""text"": ""80 = 5 x 16 is not"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""525 (P7)"","
  "        ""text"": ""lcm(7, 75) = 525"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""525 (P7)"","
  "        ""text"": ""seven sonar periods"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The calendar cycles (P8)"","
  "        ""text"": ""25,200 closes the 4-, 28- and 400-year cycles"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""The calendar cycles (P8)"","
  "        ""text"": ""and not the 19-year lunar cycle"""
  "      }"
  "    ],"
