  "        ""text"": ""store never fails"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""action: never fails, writes its cell (P4)"","
  "        ""text"": ""and changes exactly the cell it writes"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
  "        ""section"": ""the four cells of the 2 x 2, each once (P5)"","
  "        ""text"": ""the observed flags are CDL2's four cells"""
  "      },"
  "      {"
